# Extended regexes matching debian/control lines to strip for the noble build.
# One per line; a regex that matches nothing fails the build.
#
# noble's archive has no python3-orjson in any component, so the Depends line
# has to go or python3-mashumaro is uninstallable there. mashumaro reaches
# orjson only through mashumaro.codecs.orjson, which nothing on noble could
# use anyway. Drop this file when noble gains python3-orjson, which it will
# not.
^ python3-orjson,$
